PARSFILE
#FullDataName Events`H. Check Lateral Displacement`Sine with Dwell
#CheckBox1 1    
RESET_EVENTS
#CheckBox6 0    
#CheckBox7 0    

#RingCtrl0 >
#RingCtrl1 >
#RingCtrl10 2
#RingCtrl11 4
*NAME1 LatDisp
*NAME2 T
*VALUE1 abs(YCG_TM)
*VALUE2 0
*SPEED 80

DEFINE_EVENT LatDisp > abs(YCG_TM) ; Events\Events_119753f3-7b95-4719-8a25-fb16ab7edebe.par
#BlueLink0 Events`M. This Vehicle FAILED the Test` Sine with Dwell` , Events`Events_119753f3-7b95-4719-8a25-fb16ab7edebe

DEFINE_EVENT T > 0 ; Events\Events_1e59de02-0ba4-4532-b024-30c0f37484cc.par
#BlueLink1 Events`I. Clear Events and Continue to 2.929 s` Sine with Dwell` , Events`Events_1e59de02-0ba4-4532-b024-30c0f37484cc


#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset is loaded 1.07 s after a Sine with Dwell test starts, in cases where the steering amplitude is high enough to check the lateral displacement.
#
#There can be pending events when this dataset is loaded, so the box is checked to clear them.
#
#If the absolute lateral displacement is less than the parameter LatDisp the vehicle fails and testing is soon terminated.
#
#Otherwise, the event dataset I is loaded and the test continues.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

LOG_ENTRY Used Dataset: Events; { Sine with Dwell } H. Check Lateral Displacement
#Library : Events
#DataSet : H. Check Lateral Displacement
#Category: Sine with Dwell
#FileID  : Events_16cc7cb7-86a4-4c31-af4b-1c7a2f1ea4eb
#Product : CarSim 2017.1
#VehCode Events

END
